WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.880
I am sick of how mean the world is.&nbsp;

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:06.680
I'm sick to my stomach about it.
I think you are as well, I think everyone is.

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:07.720
Can we actually picture a world

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:12.200
where instead of infecting each other
with anger and upset and fear,&nbsp;

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.880
we're sparking waves of&nbsp;
kindness across the planet?&nbsp;

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:20.000
The pendulum needs to swing,
and the pendulum may indeed be swinging.&nbsp;

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.520
One of the top influencers on YouTube
is not a peddler of doom and gloom.

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:28.400
He's someone who wants to share
the amazingness of life,

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:32.560
and he does so with&nbsp;these kind of,
crazily audacious stunts.&nbsp;

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:37.320
I'm talking, of course, about MrBeast
and his 200 million subscribers.&nbsp;

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:40.507
Many of his stories are anchored in generosity.

00:00:40.507 --> 00:00:42.840
He is introducing a whole new generation

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:46.760
to the possibility that generosity&nbsp;
is&nbsp;actually really cool.

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:48.520
It's a beautiful thing.

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:53.600
Maybe the new mantra for the connected age
should be something like this:

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:55.800
"Be brave. Give what you can,&nbsp;

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:58.640
and then be absolutely amazed
at what happens next."

